Let me write slug.go:

```go
package greeter

import "strings"

// Slug 把名字转成适合做页面锚点的 URL 友好 slug：
// 转小写（大小写不敏感）、空白折成连字符、首尾不留。
func Slug(name string) string {
	return strings.ToLower(strings.Join(strings.Fields(name), "-"))
}
```

strings.Fields splits around each instance of one or more consecutive white space characters, returns slice of non-empty substrings. Join with "-". ToLower. This handles: leading/trailing whitespace gone (Fields discards empties), runs collapse to single hyphen, case lowered. Empty/whitespace-only -> "".

